        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the restrictions imposed by PRC laws and regulations on foreign ownership of companies engaged in value-added telecommunication services and certain other businesses, certain of our PRC subsidiaries entered into a series of contractual arrangements, as amended and restated, with the VIEs, as well as their respective shareholders, through such contractual arrangements we are regarded as the primary beneficiary of each of the VIEs for accounting purposes.",
        "start_character": 3713,
        "end_character": 4177
