        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a series of AI-driven subscription services targeting overseas users, primarily including (i) U-Dictionary, an online dictionary and translation app we offer in overseas market, (ii) iRecord, an audio transcription tool based on LLM capabilities;",
